      "writtenOn": "2025-07-24T18:15:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The datasheet has CTRL3_C register (0x12) can set H_LACTIVE to 0 for active high and 1 for active low. Also Zephyr\u0027s devicetree does allow this so I didn\u0027t want to ignore it if someone set it ACTIVE_HIGH in devicetree.",
